Description: BirdsLikeWires firmware for the OpenFrame 1 (26.11.31)
 The OpenFrame 1 EFI firmware release 26.11.31, and of-firmware-update, which brings
 the chip to it from stock O2, Verizon or Telstra firmware or an earlier
 release at the next boot (of-firmware.service), in an order where a power
 cut at any point leaves a chip that starts. Firmware it does not
 recognise is left alone.

